Changes compared to Scene Presets (2026, Michael Andrejews):
- Own integration domain (scene_studio), panel and room card names, so it can be installed next to
  Scene Presets; import of saved scenes, own presets and scene entities from Scene Presets
- Saved scenes with scene entities, scene editor, lamp modes
- Lights of a scene: brightness per light, optional lights, exclude, light groups as one light
- Per-light timing for dynamic scenes
- Presets from photos and replaced pictures of built-in presets
- Room card for dashboards
- Music scenes: colors from the album cover of a speaker, starting by themselves when music starts,
  return to the state before when the music stops (preset "Music" with its own drawing)
- Redesigned panel (scenes by room, presets tab), English and German texts
- Own logo and icon
- New pictures for the built-in presets (photos from Unsplash and Wikimedia Commons, see
  custom_components/scene_studio/assets/CREDITS.md), preset colors taken from these photos,
  presets with (almost) the same colors hidden, new presets, categories by content
- Tests, documentation

Files changed or added by this version carry a note at the top. The built-in presets (names and
IDs), the pictures of the presets in the category Defaults, the color logic and the dynamic scene
engine are the work of the original author.
